{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"AMO","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"阿摩司書","commonName":"阿摩司書","title":"阿摩司書","order":30,"numberOfChapters":9,"sha256":"5606ff53dbf6d121dcf5f38beb3bd015c6c14b0f2915d7372d34815a7afdda23","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":9,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/9.json","totalNumberOfVerses":146},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["猶大王烏西雅、約阿施的兒子以色列王耶羅波安執政期間，大地震前兩年，提哥亞的牧人阿摩司看到了關於以色列的異象。以下是阿摩司的話。"]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"他說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「耶和華從錫安怒吼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從耶路撒冷發聲。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"牧人的草場枯乾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"迦密山頂枯黃。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["對亞蘭的審判"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「大馬士革人三番四次地犯罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必不收回對他們的懲罰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們用打糧食的鐵器蹂躪基列。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我要降火在哈薛的王宮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"燒毀便·哈達的城堡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要折斷大馬士革城的門閂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"剷除亞文平原","poem":1},{"noteId":0},{"text":"的居民和伯·伊甸的掌權者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使亞蘭人被擄到吉珥","poem":1},{"noteId":1},{"text":"。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["對非利士的審判"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「迦薩人三番四次地犯罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必不收回對他們的懲罰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們把被擄之人全都帶走，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"賣到以東做奴隸。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我要降火在迦薩的城牆上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"燒毀它的城堡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要剷除亞實突的居民和亞實基倫的掌權者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"伸手攻擊以革倫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"剩下的非利士人都要滅亡。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是主耶和華說的。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["對泰爾的審判"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「泰爾人三番四次地犯罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必不收回對他們的懲罰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們背棄弟兄之盟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把被擄之人都賣到以東。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我要降火在泰爾的城牆上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"燒毀它的城堡。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["對以東的審判"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「以東人三番四次地犯罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必不收回對他們的懲罰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們拔刀追趕自己的弟兄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沒有半點憐憫之心；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們怒氣不息，永懷憤怒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我要降火在提幔，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"燒毀波斯拉的城堡。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["對亞捫的審判"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「亞捫人三番四次地犯罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必不收回對他們的懲罰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們為了擴張領土，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"竟剖開基列孕婦的肚腹。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我要在戰爭的吶喊聲中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在狂風暴雨襲來時，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"降火在拉巴的城牆上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"燒毀它的城堡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的君王和首領要一同被擄。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"「亞文平原」希伯來文是「邪惡谷」。亞文平原和伯·伊甸皆屬於亞蘭人。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":5}},{"noteId":1,"caller":"+","text":"吉珥的位置不詳，亞蘭人原來自吉珥。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":5}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOL/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}